{
  "_comment_first_run": "Leave allele_tag empty on the first submission. The task then runs the join in --census-only mode and phase_summary carries the spanning BAM's SAM-tag census; read the tag holding the allele index out of it and re-submit with allele_tag set. The tag is TRGT-version-dependent, so a guessed default would give an empty join instead of an error.",
  "_comment_window": "chr20:10000000-20000000 is the window TrgtLocusConcordance already ran, so its CONCORDANCE table is directly comparable.",

  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.sample_id": "1000234",
  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.region": "chr20:10000000-20000000",

  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.bam": "gs://prod-drc-broad/v9/lrWGS/haplotagged_bams/1000234.bam",
  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.bam_index": "gs://prod-drc-broad/v9/lrWGS/haplotagged_bams/1000234.bam.bai",

  "_comment_phased_vcf": "The ligated phased callset for the chromosome (flare_lai_prod.gt_vcf / ligated_vcf). This file DEFINES the haplotype frame: slot 0 is the haplotype AN1 describes. Do not substitute the FLARE anc VCF.",
  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.phased_vcf": "<flare_lai_prod.gt_vcf for chr20>",
  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.phased_vcf_index": "<flare_lai_prod.gt_vcf_index for chr20>",

  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.reference_fasta": "gs://prod-drc-broad/longreads/references/GRCh38_noalt/GCA_000001405.15_GRCh38_no_alt_analysis_set.fa",
  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.reference_fasta_index": "gs://prod-drc-broad/longreads/references/GRCh38_noalt/GCA_000001405.15_GRCh38_no_alt_analysis_set.fa.fai",
  "_comment_repeats": "TRGT's OWN definition format: 4 tab fields, chrom start end ID=<trid>;MOTIFS=<m>;STRUC=<s>. NOT refs/repeat_loci/trexplorer_v1.0.1.catalog.bed.gz, which is the 5-column file (chrom start end TRID motifs) trgt_plvi.py derives for aggregate_repeat_loci.py; it has dropped STRUC and cannot be converted. Rebuild it from any production TRGT output VCF with scripts/trgt_defs_from_vcf.py, which round-trips TRID/MOTIFS/STRUC out of INFO; that is by construction the definition set those calls were genotyped against.",
  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.trgt_repeats_bed": "gs://fc-secure-8f7d6a20-04ce-40d7-8c88-aececeac3e09/refs/repeat_loci/trexplorer_v1.0.1.trgt_definitions.bed.gz",

  "_comment_production": "Optional: the as-delivered TRGT call for this sample, sliced to the window so the notebook can compare re-genotyped against delivered calls. Path from tractor_mix/resources/trgt_table.txt.",
  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.production_trgt_vcf": "gs://fc-secure-8f7d6a20-04ce-40d7-8c88-aececeac3e09/CCS/terra-d45cc5ca/outputs/GRCh38/TRGT/TR_Explorer_1.01/1000234_trgt.TR_Explorer_1.01.vcf.gz",
  "TrgtHaplotypePhase.production_trgt_vcf_index": "gs://fc-secure-8f7d6a20-04ce-40d7-8c88-aececeac3e09/CCS/terra-d45cc5ca/outputs/GRCh38/TRGT/TR_Explorer_1.01/1000234_trgt.TR_Explorer_1.01.vcf.gz.tbi",

